RUN: not %COMPILE --error-format clang build plc.json 2>&1 | %CHECK %s

A block element is located by the diagram it sits in and its execution order:
`<file>.cfc.<diagram>:<order>`. The block itself is the fault, so no pin index
follows the order.
CHECK: {{.*}}unknown_type.cfc.unknown_type:0: error[E146]: Block `counter` refers to an undeclared POU
CHECK: error: Compilation aborted due to critical errors
